V2.0.0  
      A small function using fc something like:
      h() {
          # Get the last command from history
          last_cmd=$(fc -ln -1)
    
          # Run the last command with --help appended
          eval "$last_cmd --help"
      }

V1.0.0
      Simply an alias
      alias h='eval "$(history -p \!\! | awk '\''{print $1}'\'')" --help'
